;; The server core's back-edges that stand today (docs/server-layers.md).
;; Each entry is [from to]: `from` reaches `to`, a namespace above it in
;; waymark10.server-layers-test/layers, by its requires. The test fails
;; on a back-edge missing here and on an entry here that is gone, so
;; this list only shrinks: a split that removes one removes its line.
#{;; invoke's make-ctx: (requiring-resolve 'waymark10.server.replay/history)
  ;; (and replay/window, replay/*tx*) -> replay -> measure -> grants
  [waymark10.server.invoke waymark10.server.grants]
  ;; seats: (requiring-resolve 'waymark10.server.replay-walks/replay), two
  ;; calls -> replay-walks -> waiting-on -> cracks -> held-calls
  [waymark10.server.seats waymark10.server.held-calls]}
